  "content": "<p>Hannah Aubry is leaving Mastodon after her time with us as community director and board member. We\u2019re very grateful for her contributions, ideas, and commitment to Mastodon and the fediverse. Thank you, Hannah! We wish you all the very best for what comes next.</p>",
