   "quotes_count": 18,
   "edited_at": null,
   "content": "<p>We just released Mastodon 4.7.0!</p><p>This version contains very few user-facing changes, but significantly reworks the backend code to improve security and support new protocol features.</p><p>You can read more about it on our blog: <a href=\"https://blog.joinmastodon.org/2026/08/mastodon-4.7/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">blog.joinmastodon.org/2026/08/</span><span class=\"invisible\">mastodon-4.7/</span></a></p><p>Note for admins: the database migrations might take a long time, this is expected (see the release notes).</p><p>Release notes and upgrade instructions are available here: <a href=\"https://github.com/mastodon/mastodon/releases/tag/v4.7.0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">github.com/mastodon/mastodon/r</span><span class=\"invisible\">eleases/tag/v4.7.0</span></a></p><p><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/tags/mastoadmin\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>mastoadmin</span></a></p>",
   "reblog": null,
